==Battleground==
*9 [[Firecracker]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 5.33~8.67 seconds<sup>160f~260f</sup>.
*1 [[Celeboodle]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Mistress Celeboodle]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Devil Wife]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Firecracker]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**25 [[Firecracker]]s spawn after 0.33 seconds<sup>10f</sup>, delay 4.67~8 seconds<sup>140f~240f</sup>.
**3 [[Capy|Capies]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 21.33~23.33 seconds<sup>640f~700f</sup>.
**5 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16 seconds<sup>480f</sup>.
**12 [[Firecracker]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~5.33 seconds<sup>100f~160f</sup>.

==Strategy==
For this stage, you should bring 2-4 75¢ meatshields, as most of the foes have high damage Single Attacks. Be sure to bring Anti-[[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] crowd-controllers, as the J.K. Bun Bun can tear through meatshields, leaving attackers exposed. Spammable Area Attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] make quick work of the boss, while taking care of the weaker peons. Thankfully, the Celeboodles variants provide ample cash throughout all points of the fight and pose little issue. Although Devil Wife Death Surges may be annoying, it shouldn't be enough to lock your timed rewards.

